## Tech stack

| Concern | Choice |
|---|---|
| Web framework | FastAPI + Pydantic v2 |
| LLM | Groq (OpenAI-compatible endpoint) |
| Embeddings | `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2` (384 dimensions, runs locally) |
| Vector store | Qdrant |
| Metadata and bookings | PostgreSQL via SQLAlchemy 2.0 |
| Chat memory | Redis |
| PDF parsing | pypdf |

