## Data model

**documents:** `id`, `filename`, `file_type`, `chunk_strategy`, `chunk_count`, `created_at`

**bookings:** `id`, `name`, `email`, `date`, `time`, `created_at`

Qdrant payload per chunk: `document_id`, `chunk_index`, `text`

