## Known limitations and future improvements

- Synchronous service clients; moving to async clients would improve throughput.
- No reranking step; a cross-encoder could improve retrieval quality.
- Retrieval searches all documents; adding a `document_id` filter would allow scoped questions.
- No authentication or rate limiting.
- Character-based chunk sizes; token-based chunking would align better with model limits.
- Scanned PDFs are not supported (no OCR).
- Embedding and ingestion run inside the request; a background worker queue would suit large files.
- Booking confirmation is stored, but no email is actually sent.

